# from:length: counts characters and survives very large numbers
>> s := ['ééééééééééééééé'].
Chiqish yozish: (s nusxa boshlab: 0 uzunlik: 20), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (s nusxa boshlab: 10 uzunlik: 20), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (s nusxa boshlab: 14 uzunlik: 1), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (s nusxa surish: 20), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['-'], yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abcdef'] boshlab: 2 uzunlik: 2), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abc'] boshlab: 1 uzunlik: ['9e300'] son), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abc'] boshlab: 1 uzunlik: ['-9e300'] son), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abc'] boshlab: ['9e300'] son uzunlik: 1), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['-'], yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abc'] boshlab: ['-9e300'] son uzunlik: 2), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abc'] boshlab: ['nan'] son uzunlik: 2), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['abc'] boshlab: 0 uzunlik: ['nan'] son), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ['-'], yangi-qator.
